{
    "title": "Willy Wonka Vegas Casino Slots",
    "description": "Willy Wonka Slots is your lucky ticket to a FREE casino-style slot machine game. Zynga brings you these ultimate exciting free slots games to enjoy an authentic Las Vegas experience with the iconic cast of Willy Wonka and the Chocolate Factory movie!\r\n\r\nIt's your lucky day today\u2026 Start spinning and get the coins rolling! \r\nSpin to win amazing prizes in this scrumptious free slot game! Create your very own basket of crazy Wonka creations in Wonka's Secret Recipes, our latest mini-game. Spin on casino game machines to collect Wonka\u2019s factory ingredients and watch the coin Credits roll in!\r\nPlay is sweeter than ever with free casino slots, fun mini-games and Las Vegas-style slot machines!\r\n\r\nJoin Charlie as he tours the most eccentric and wonderful confectionery factory of all, Willy Wonka\u2019s Chocolate Factory.\r\n- More frequent JACKPOT wins and the biggest bonus wins!\r\n- New slot machines added every 2 weeks!\r\n- Access the top favorite slots casino machines\r\n- Compete against other slot players in the game\r\n- Get immersed in Wonka\u2019s land of imagination\r\n- Creative arts and mini-games to make a fun game experience\r\n- Unique bonus modes and free spin games\r\n\r\nWILLY WONKA SLOTS FEATURES:\r\n\r\nFREE CASINO SLOTS MEET THE MUSICAL FANTASY FILM\r\nFree slot-machines with your favorite characters and settings from the film.\r\nFree casino game slots take you on a tour of Wonka\u2019s factory, with each level taking you further into the Chocolate Factory and your favorite characters\u2019 stories!\r\n\r\nBONUS SLOTS & DELECTABLE FREE SPINS\r\nSlot machine games that give you the chance to win BIG with the 3 Course Bonus, Streak Bonus and VIP Bonus.\r\nBet big in this slots game to win billions of FREE CREDITS and dozens of bonuses!\r\nEarn huge wins with delectable Free Spins and sweet JACKPOT pay-outs.\r\nSpin the prize wheel to get big wins and sweet rewards like extra coins.\r\n\r\nSLOTS - THE MOST EXCITING SPINS AVAILABLE ANYWHERE\r\nSpin slots online or offline, wherever you go.\r\nSend and receive Wonka Bar gifts between you and your friends.\r\nView your friends\u2019 progress by connecting to Facebook.\r\nKeep playing! You can sync your level of play across all your devices.\r\n\r\nWONKA\u2019S (VIP) SLOTS CLUB, PREMIUM PASS, CARDS COLLECTIONS AND OTHER ATTRACTIVE FEATURES\r\nParticipate in the weekly challenges and get a chance to play against other slot players.\r\nBecome a part of the prestigious Wonka\u2019s (VIP) Slots Club that gives access to premium VIP casino machines.\r\nBuy our monthly Premium Pass to get exclusive rewards and challenges.\r\nUp your game with the exciting cards collection to boost your in-game experience.\r\nDownload Willy Wonka Slots for the sweetest and most authentic slot machines. Don\u2019t wait \u2013 Your delicious wins await!\r\n\r\nFROM THE MAKERS OF WIZARD OF OZ SLOTS and HIT IT RICH!\r\n\r\nAdditional information:\r\n\u00b7 This slot machine game is intended for an adult audience and does not offer real-money gambling or an opportunity to win real-money or prizes. Practice or success in social gaming does not imply future success at real-money gambling.\r\n\u00b7 The game is free to play; however, in-app purchases are available for additional content and in-game currency.\r\n\u00b7 Use of this application is governed by Zynga\u2019s Terms of Service, found at www.zynga.com/legal/terms-of-service.\r\n\u00b7 For information about how Zynga uses personal data, please read our privacy policy at https://www.take2games.com/privacy.\r\n\r\nWILLY WONKA AND THE CHOCOLATE FACTORY and all related characters and elements \u00a9 & \u2122 Warner Bros. Entertainment Inc. (s21)",
